    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever thought you could create works in the style of Van Gogh or Monet, even without professional painting skills?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI PAINTER: Painting Simulator makes this idea a reality. We use advanced AI technology to deploy an art partner on your local computer. It can transform your every doodle into a stunning piece of art in real time. This is not just a game, but a powerful creative tool that allows everyone to experience the joy of co-creating with AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010How AI Creates With You\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. <strong>Local AI, Instant Response</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you start the game, the built-in AI service loads automatically on your computer. We've optimized the loading process, and you'll see a clear progress bar. The entire process is offline, protecting your privacy and data security.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. <strong>Real-time Generation, What You See Is What You Get</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scribble colors and lines on the canvas, and the AI canvas will display the AI-interpreted image in real time. The better your computer's configuration, the faster the response. Some high-performance PCs can achieve almost lag-free real-time painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. <strong>Style Learning, From Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By completing challenges, you can collect various art cards. Behind each card are the key &quot;prompt words&quot; that drive the AI to generate a specific style. Select a &quot;Sunflowers&quot; card, and your brushstrokes can generate a work full of Van Gogh's passion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Core Gameplay &amp; Features\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>A True AI Painting Partner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional painting software, you are not creating alone. The core of AI PAINTER: Painting Simulator is the interaction between human and AI. You are responsible for creativity and composition, and the AI is responsible for polishing and stylizing, completing a piece of work together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Zero Barrier, No Painting Skills Required</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for all who love creativity. Simple doodles are enough to guide the AI, allowing you to focus on expressing your ideas rather than being constrained by painting techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Free Painting Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no restrictions, freely enter prompts and let the AI turn your imagination into reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Card Challenge Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create using the specific art cards provided in the game, and the AI will score your work based on how well it matches the target style, allowing you to continuously improve through practice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Rich Art Style Library</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the light and shadow of Impressionism to the colors of Expressionism, experience and create the art styles of different masters by collecting cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe that AI is a powerful tool to enhance human creativity, not replace it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join AI PAINTER: Painting Simulator and see what wonders we can create together.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever thought you could create works in the style of Van Gogh or Monet, even without professional painting skills?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI PAINTER: Painting Simulator makes this idea a reality. We use advanced AI technology to deploy an art partner on your local computer. It can transform your every doodle into a stunning piece of art in real time. This is not just a game, but a powerful creative tool that allows everyone to experience the joy of co-creating with AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010How AI Creates With You\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. <strong>Local AI, Instant Response</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you start the game, the built-in AI service loads automatically on your computer. We've optimized the loading process, and you'll see a clear progress bar. The entire process is offline, protecting your privacy and data security.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. <strong>Real-time Generation, What You See Is What You Get</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scribble colors and lines on the canvas, and the AI canvas will display the AI-interpreted image in real time. The better your computer's configuration, the faster the response. Some high-performance PCs can achieve almost lag-free real-time painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. <strong>Style Learning, From Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By completing challenges, you can collect various art cards. Behind each card are the key &quot;prompt words&quot; that drive the AI to generate a specific style. Select a &quot;Sunflowers&quot; card, and your brushstrokes can generate a work full of Van Gogh's passion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Core Gameplay &amp; Features\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>A True AI Painting Partner</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional painting software, you are not creating alone. The core of AI PAINTER: Painting Simulator is the interaction between human and AI. You are responsible for creativity and composition, and the AI is responsible for polishing and stylizing, completing a piece of work together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Zero Barrier, No Painting Skills Required</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for all who love creativity. Simple doodles are enough to guide the AI, allowing you to focus on expressing your ideas rather than being constrained by painting techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Free Painting Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no restrictions, freely enter prompts and let the AI turn your imagination into reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Card Challenge Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create using the specific art cards provided in the game, and the AI will score your work based on how well it matches the target style, allowing you to continuously improve through practice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Rich Art Style Library</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the light and shadow of Impressionism to the colors of Expressionism, experience and create the art styles of different masters by collecting cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We believe that AI is a powerful tool to enhance human creativity, not replace it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join AI PAINTER: Painting Simulator and see what wonders we can create together.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a painting simulator unlike any other. Here, AI is not a cold tool, but the brush in your hand, your partner in inspiration. No artistic skill is required; with a simple doodle, the AI can generate a unique piece of art for you in real time.",
